{"ID":"20240118144958-p9bqcvu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144958-p9bqcvu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144958-p9bqcvu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144958-ljgd9sc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240204162233-zu6ilzo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:111,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122165840-gpjmhmd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:301,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:301\u0026#125;","title":"367补10豆豉（香豉）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204162238"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144958-ljgd9sc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144958-ljgd9sc","updated":"20240122165831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，为一般食物调味之用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165833-vqgvehm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165833-vqgvehm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】色黑味咸，无毒，形如心，色如肾，味咸入肾，故治火中之水，令水火相济。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165834-1q7lf3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165834-1q7lf3o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】主治心中懊憹也，旁治心中结痛及心中满而烦也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165836-rynvmyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165836-rynvmyt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【倪注】经方中之栀子豆豉汤主治心中懊憹，一般多用于病愈后之失眠烦躁。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165838-r2v4y8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165838-r2v4y8a"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165839-1zphgwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165839-1zphgwn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】多无禁忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165832-pfviq44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165832-pfviq44"}},{"ID":"20240122165840-p1ch91z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165840-p1ch91z"}},{"ID":"20240122165840-gpjmhmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165840-gpjmhmd","updated":"20240204162238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个第十位是豆鼓，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"豆鼓呢是用黑大豆做出来的，又名为香鼓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是我们一般吃的豆鼓，你到外面去吃豆鼓蒸鱼啊就是那个豆鼓，色黑味咸没有毒，诸位看它颜色是黑的所以入肾，味道咸的就入肾对不对，所以它能"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治火中之水令水火相济"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，中医的观念里面呢这个水，活的水呢只要是任何活的水，水里面都要有阳，那这个如果这个阳不见了，水里面没有阳了以后人就会重症失眠，那我们让水里面的火能够归位就是豆豉，它是治火中的水，水火既济，那治心中懊憹，也旁治心中结痛，心中满而烦都可以用，那经方里面的栀子豆鼓汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子豆豉汤一般我们是用在经方里面是用在大虚之后的这个失眠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以病人呢在生完一场大病以后，病初愈的时候有失眠的现象产生我们用栀子豆豉汤，极虚的人我们才会用栀子豆豉汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240204162233-zu6ilzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204162233-zu6ilzo"}}]}